## Background and Motivation

Many crypto objects currently require `byte[]` inputs, frequently lacking overloads which accept an offset and count parameter.  These objects frequently can accept a `ReadOnlySpan<byte>`, since they either parse once or make defensive copies, but currently force span-based callers to use intermediate arrays.

## Proposed API

