This proposal creates a `ReadOnlySpan<byte>` overload for every method or constructor in X509Certificates or Pkcs that accepts a `byte[]` EXCEPT for System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs.ContentInfo (the array ctor does not make a defensive copy) or the System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs.Pkcs9AttributeObject hierarchy, due to complications with the package cross-compiling, and the span-based uptake of those attributes isn't worth exploding the TFM set further)

It also creates `ReadOnlySpan<char>` overload for PFX importers' password property, to allow for stack-based inputs.

Finally, it adds default parameters to X509Certificate2Collection.Import X509KeyStorageFlags parameters, for "symmetry" with X509Certificate2's two-parameter ctors.

